{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833820/extras/74db24190c1ceb0f8ac11da268fe2a6d.poster.avif?t=1767043740\" width=800 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833820/extras/74db24190c1ceb0f8ac11da268fe2a6d.webm?t=1767043740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833820/extras/74db24190c1ceb0f8ac11da268fe2a6d.mp4?t=1767043740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Goblin Brothers in Trouble</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pair of goblin brothers got into trouble with a wizard mage because Spike couldn\u2019t control his addiction to tomatoes. Now they\u2019re locked underground in the mage\u2019s tower, but they won\u2019t stay still and will look for a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833820/extras/a4e312482accc921992dbe2335701479.avif?t=1767043740\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833820/extras_big/a4e312482accc921992dbe2335701479.avif?t=1767043740 width=800 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To play locally</strong>, you need 1 controller and a keyboard, or 2 controllers. Two players can't play on the same keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833820/extras/264f879f1ec667026ebbe6e6185159ef.poster.avif?t=1767043740\" width=676 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833820/extras/264f879f1ec667026ebbe6e6185159ef.webm?t=1767043740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833820/extras/264f879f1ec667026ebbe6e6185159ef.mp4?t=1767043740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperate, solve, and escape!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an exciting cooperative puzzle adventure where you and your partner must combine wit and teamwork to overcome four challenging main rooms. Only by solving each obstacle together will you find the way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833820/extras/e377bce98d4db6dda0a3cdbc04766580.poster.avif?t=1767043740\" width=674 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833820/extras/e377bce98d4db6dda0a3cdbc04766580.webm?t=1767043740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833820/extras/e377bce98d4db6dda0a3cdbc04766580.mp4?t=1767043740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Search and think</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive puzzles from misplaced pipes, deciphering notes with riddles scattered across the map, finding hidden keys, and facing many more enigmas that will require observation, logic, and collaboration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833820/extras/e0c39f858956ae223a86775f063b2972.poster.avif?t=1767043740\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833820/extras/e0c39f858956ae223a86775f063b2972.webm?t=1767043740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833820/extras/e0c39f858956ae223a86775f063b2972.mp4?t=1767043740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fulfill a unique role</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player is important and has their strengths while Spike is the only one who can read, and Gobo has the strength to do the heavy work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833820/extras/36c74f3ace4657147bf668af8754b068.poster.avif?t=1767043740\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833820/extras/36c74f3ace4657147bf668af8754b068.webm?t=1767043740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833820/extras/36c74f3ace4657147bf668af8754b068.mp4?t=1767043740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Riddle Riddlish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3833820/8d936f8cbd5e67f99825621c37f7e11c9cbfc636.jpg"},{"name":"Part-Time Plumber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3833820/2f08f7d9847958ab36819752d0fdde793cde8307.jpg"},{"name":"A Bit of Chemistry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3833820/75d6638bce193dee92957119fa968617ce752fe7.jpg"},{"name":"They Do This Every Morning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3833820/eb49855303b6e85948f7bd74dd7090a5f1b002c0.jpg"},{"name":"Freeeeedom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3833820/98b1